Kind: ablation
Issue: #953
Takes out: libposix-uros's use of proc_sig_default() -- the signal thread takes a signal's default action from its own list again, which leaves out SIGSTKFLT, SIGXCPU, SIGXFSZ, SIGVTALRM, SIGPROF, SIGIO, SIGPWR and SIGSYS and drops each: musl_test's [50] must see the eight leave their children to go on
Run: --entry 14 600 -smp 4
Expect: musl_test: \[50\] WRONG -- .*of the eight, one or more did NOT end its child by that signal

diff --git a/uros/src/lib/libposix-uros/signals.c b/uros/src/lib/libposix-uros/signals.c
index 84d5844d..99d5dcb2 100644
--- a/uros/src/lib/libposix-uros/signals.c
